{"1372150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fish Game", "steam_appid": 1372150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3213040, 3459300, 3537170, 3537180, 3794510, 3925080, 4941890], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/95c1d92747947069b8b0fc0070c7fc42.poster.avif?t=1785858866\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/95c1d92747947069b8b0fc0070c7fc42.webm?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/95c1d92747947069b8b0fc0070c7fc42.mp4?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Game is the de-fin-itive freshwater fishkeeping sim experience made *for* enthusiasts *by* enthusiasts. Featuring fish with personalities and dynamic relationships, water quality modeling, plants that grow and much more! Made with support from Destin and our friends at “Smarter Every Day”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/9879c429516a0376cee26f802d93c6b7.poster.avif?t=1785858866\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/9879c429516a0376cee26f802d93c6b7.webm?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/9879c429516a0376cee26f802d93c6b7.mp4?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/04fb04df9bc69d775e23ce99fa9da4e4.poster.avif?t=1785858866\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/04fb04df9bc69d775e23ce99fa9da4e4.webm?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/04fb04df9bc69d775e23ce99fa9da4e4.mp4?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/aabd87c8b1c8436d00e88d91af2051ed.poster.avif?t=1785858866\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/aabd87c8b1c8436d00e88d91af2051ed.webm?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/aabd87c8b1c8436d00e88d91af2051ed.mp4?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature list:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 130 types of Fish with distinct personalities and behavioral quirks, leading to infinite, evolving and dynamic relationships with complex hierarchies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of behaviors, including schooling, chasing, fighting, and even carnivorous behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Propagating aquatic plants (50 species) for you to adopt and raise. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 types of rocks, driftwood, and novelty hardscape, including setpieces from some of your favorite games! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 types of fully sculptable substrate, layer-able and in a variety of colors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive hunger and food systems, with 11 types of food for herbivores, omnivores and carnivores, whether they're grazers, opportunists or predators. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable content and mechanics via fishkeeper XP. Upgrade Tanks from 7 to 3000 gallons, upgrade shops for rarer critters, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An economy-free shopping experience focused more on discovering rare treasures--no grinding for currency! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated carbon dioxide, ammonia, and oxygen levels that have intricate relationships with your fish, plants, algae, light levels, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing “No Death Mode”. Put a living, breathing aquarium on your TV with Steam Link! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode: take great pictures and set up fantastic dolly shots to share with your friends and participate in community contests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable on Steam Deck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Updates:</strong> <br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Water Chemistry &amp; Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Plant Needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Aquadex”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breeding, with genetics and mutations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant improvements and minor content additions<br><br>It doesn’t get any betta than this!  Start crafting your dream aquarium in Fish Game today!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/95c1d92747947069b8b0fc0070c7fc42.poster.avif?t=1785858866\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/95c1d92747947069b8b0fc0070c7fc42.webm?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/95c1d92747947069b8b0fc0070c7fc42.mp4?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Game is the de-fin-itive freshwater fishkeeping sim experience made *for* enthusiasts *by* enthusiasts. Featuring fish with personalities and dynamic relationships, water quality modeling, plants that grow and much more! Made with support from Destin and our friends at “Smarter Every Day”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/9879c429516a0376cee26f802d93c6b7.poster.avif?t=1785858866\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/9879c429516a0376cee26f802d93c6b7.webm?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/9879c429516a0376cee26f802d93c6b7.mp4?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/04fb04df9bc69d775e23ce99fa9da4e4.poster.avif?t=1785858866\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/04fb04df9bc69d775e23ce99fa9da4e4.webm?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/04fb04df9bc69d775e23ce99fa9da4e4.mp4?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/aabd87c8b1c8436d00e88d91af2051ed.poster.avif?t=1785858866\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/aabd87c8b1c8436d00e88d91af2051ed.webm?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/extras/aabd87c8b1c8436d00e88d91af2051ed.mp4?t=1785858866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature list:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 130 types of Fish with distinct personalities and behavioral quirks, leading to infinite, evolving and dynamic relationships with complex hierarchies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of behaviors, including schooling, chasing, fighting, and even carnivorous behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Propagating aquatic plants (50 species) for you to adopt and raise. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 types of rocks, driftwood, and novelty hardscape, including setpieces from some of your favorite games! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 types of fully sculptable substrate, layer-able and in a variety of colors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive hunger and food systems, with 11 types of food for herbivores, omnivores and carnivores, whether they're grazers, opportunists or predators. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable content and mechanics via fishkeeper XP. Upgrade Tanks from 7 to 3000 gallons, upgrade shops for rarer critters, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An economy-free shopping experience focused more on discovering rare treasures--no grinding for currency! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated carbon dioxide, ammonia, and oxygen levels that have intricate relationships with your fish, plants, algae, light levels, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing “No Death Mode”. Put a living, breathing aquarium on your TV with Steam Link! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode: take great pictures and set up fantastic dolly shots to share with your friends and participate in community contests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable on Steam Deck!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Updates:</strong> <br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Water Chemistry &amp; Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Plant Needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Aquadex”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breeding, with genetics and mutations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant improvements and minor content additions<br><br>It doesn’t get any betta than this!  Start crafting your dream aquarium in Fish Game today!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fish Game is a detailed and highly “sofishticated” freshwater aquarium simulator, lovingly crafted *by* enthusiasts *for* enthusiasts! Featuring fish with personalities and dynamic relationships, water quality modeling, and so much more! Made with support from our friends at Smarter Every Day!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Amazing Aquarium Simulator”<br>Drae<br><br>“I’ve explored most other popularised aquarium simulators. . . none have quite satisfied my aquatic cravings like Fish Game.”<br>Pixel Nook<br><br>“Greatest Aquarium Game Ever Made?”<br>Mistah H1N1<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/144fe10b68a30c2e5426d18be8d244c782be0ba7/header.jpg?t=1785858866", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/f6647884c8a36352cac5e9d35fe375b017f7c382/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785858866", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372150/f6647884c8a36352cac5e9d35fe375b017f7c382/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785858866", "website": "https://www.fish.game/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-4430S CPU @ 2.70GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> iMac Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Copyright A Shell in the Pit Games Inc. 2022", "developers": ["A Shell in the Pit Games", "Creative Ink Games"], "publishers": ["A Shell in the Pit Games"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 2499, "final": 2499, "discount_percent": 0, "ini